        "subject": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add ku runner, KUNIT.list and KUNIT.modules_list",
        "message": "DRAFT LU-21180 kunit: add ku runner, KUNIT.list and KUNIT.modules_list\n\nAdd lustre/kunit/ku: maps files changed in the working tree (git diff,\nor an explicit revspec/file list) to kunit test modules via\nper-directory KUNIT.list globs and lustre/kunit/KUNIT.modules_list\n(each module's .ko path and dependency .ko's), then insmod's/rmmod's\neach selected module in turn, checking dmesg for the KTAP pass/fail\nsummary and stopping at the first failure.\n\nAdd lustre/lod/KUNIT.list for lod_comp_test, lod_merge_test and\nlod_mirror_test against '*.[ch]'.\n\nTest-Parameters: ignore\nSigned-off-by: Ronnie Sahlberg <rsahlberg@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: Idff1a9308c542a7cb187f88d1b4e4013d7b76f92\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
